  "primary": "Two endpoints form the confirmatory family: H7 library and the independent H8 full workspace build, treated separately. For each, 16 adjacent pairs of full real Cargo process instruction counts. Define reduction as 100*(1-C/P) per pair, report median and a distribution-free median interval from order statistics 4 through 13 of 16 (~97.87% coverage). Test mean log(P/C) using the exact 12,870 balanced assignments to first/second, one-sided for a reduction, Holm across both. Require >=1% median, >=13/16 favorable, lower median interval >0 and Holm p<.05 for both before claiming a cross-workload performance improvement.",
